    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Spellcasting or Pact Magic Feature)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Additional Spells.</strong> Your mastery keeps certain spells always at the ready. Once you have spell slots of a level shown in the Divination Adept Spells table, you always have the spells of that level and lower prepared.</p><p><strong>Prescient Intervention.</strong> When a creature you can see within 60 feet of you makes a D20 Test, you can take a Reaction to give it Advantage or Disadvantage (your choice) on that roll. Once you use this benefit, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest, or until you cast a Divination spell with a spell slot.</p><h4>Divination Adept Spells</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Slot Level</th><th>Spell</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDetectEvil]{Detect Evil and Good}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMindSpike0]{Mind Spike}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplClairvoyan]{Clairvoyance}</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDivination]{Divination}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScrying000]{Scrying}</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-YJqHHlj1evhmJByW\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Choose the spells of the levels whose slots you have; add the others when you gain those slots. Restore the use yourself when you cast a Divination spell with a spell slot.</p></section>",
